{
    "title": "Arcadia Mahjong",
    "description": "<b>Arcadia Mahjong</b> is a trending mahjong solitaire puzzle game, designed for seniors and the elderly, with exclusive and well-designed game features. We are aiming to provide you with a brand new mahjong tile journey and eager to introduce this classic Mahjong solitaire game to  seniors and the elderly. Unlike general mahjong games, it offers larger mahjong tiles that are easy to read and a rotation mode especially for seniors and the elderly, allowing you to switch your device horizontally or vertically.\r\n \r\n<b> How To Play </b>:\r\n-- Match identical mahjong tiles and clear the board to pass the level.\r\n-- Tap two matching mahjong tiles to eliminate them.\r\n-- Concealed or blocked tiles can't be eliminated. Once you complete a mahjong tile matching level, you can move on to the next oriental journey and train your brain as you progress.\r\n \r\n<b> Premium Features </b>:\r\n-- A larger board and tiles & pad-friendly, with different levels and experiences tailored to each orientation. You can switch the screen to play the tile matching and mahjong solitaire game horizontally and vertically.\r\n-- Immersive oriental scenery. You can experience the beauty of oriental landscapes with various scenes and elements. \r\n-- Collect oriental sticker album. Finish levels to collect and explore a variety of stickers featuring oriental cuisine, animals, architecture, plants, clothing, and artworks.\r\n-- Massive 10,000+ uniquely designed levels. Enjoy over ten thousand mahjong solitaire levels, each crafted individually for a unique game experience.\r\n-- Daily Challenge. Take on daily challenges that are more difficult than regular matching levels and earn stickers more efficiently.\r\n-- Show off your skills. Make combos by consecutively matching tiles during the game without time limitations!\r\n-- Use helpful props. Helpful props like hints, shuffle, etc are provided. If you get stuck, try these props!\r\n \r\n<b> Benefits of this game that is designed for seniors and the elderly</b>:\r\n-- Train Senior's Brain: making consecutive  combos requires a faster finger movement and a good eyesight. \r\n-- Relax Senior's Mind: <b>Arcadia Mahjong</b> requires to focus and strategically think, diverting your attention from stress and tiredness.\r\n-- Improve Senior's Memory Ability: This game involves identifying identical patterns, and remembering and recalling last moves. \r\n \r\nIf you are a fan of tile matching and mahjong solitaire games, <b>Arcadia Mahjong</b> will be your best companion! This mahjong solitaire game is now well received by seniors and the elderly group. Download now and join the senior mahjong fan club!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Arcadia Mahjong</b> is a trending mahjong solitaire puzzle game, designed for seniors and the elderly, with exclusive and well-designed game features. We are aiming to provide you with a brand new mahjong tile journey and eager to introduce this classic Mahjong solitaire game to  seniors and the elderly. Unlike general mahjong games, it offers larger mahjong tiles that are easy to read and a rotation mode especially for seniors and the elderly, allowing you to switch your device horizontally or vertically.<br> <br><b> How To Play </b>:<br>-- Match identical mahjong tiles and clear the board to pass the level.<br>-- Tap two matching mahjong tiles to eliminate them.<br>-- Concealed or blocked tiles can&#39;t be eliminated. Once you complete a mahjong tile matching level, you can move on to the next oriental journey and train your brain as you progress.<br> <br><b> Premium Features </b>:<br>-- A larger board and tiles &amp; pad-friendly, with different levels and experiences tailored to each orientation. You can switch the screen to play the tile matching and mahjong solitaire game horizontally and vertically.<br>-- Immersive oriental scenery. You can experience the beauty of oriental landscapes with various scenes and elements. <br>-- Collect oriental sticker album. Finish levels to collect and explore a variety of stickers featuring oriental cuisine, animals, architecture, plants, clothing, and artworks.<br>-- Massive 10,000+ uniquely designed levels. Enjoy over ten thousand mahjong solitaire levels, each crafted individually for a unique game experience.<br>-- Daily Challenge. Take on daily challenges that are more difficult than regular matching levels and earn stickers more efficiently.<br>-- Show off your skills. Make combos by consecutively matching tiles during the game without time limitations!<br>-- Use helpful props. Helpful props like hints, shuffle, etc are provided. If you get stuck, try these props!<br> <br><b> Benefits of this game that is designed for seniors and the elderly</b>:<br>-- Train Senior&#39;s Brain: making consecutive  combos requires a faster finger movement and a good eyesight. <br>-- Relax Senior&#39;s Mind: <b>Arcadia Mahjong</b> requires to focus and strategically think, diverting your attention from stress and tiredness.<br>-- Improve Senior&#39;s Memory Ability: This game involves identifying identical patterns, and remembering and recalling last moves. <br> <br>If you are a fan of tile matching and mahjong solitaire games, <b>Arcadia Mahjong</b> will be your best companion! This mahjong solitaire game is now well received by seniors and the elderly group. Download now and join the senior mahjong fan club!",
